[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0202","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3071","title":"Google Chrome HTMLMediaElement 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 HTMLMediaElement 实现存在使用后释放漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发内存错误引用导致浏览器崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 18.0.1025.151 之前版本，属于远程攻击向量，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证即可利用，可能造成服务拒绝、信息泄露及完整性破坏。CVSS 评分 6.8（中危），CWE-416 类型。Google 已在 Chrome 18.0.1025.151 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级浏览器至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3071"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-05T22:02:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 18.0.1025.151 或更高版本。通过浏览器菜单选择「帮助」→「关于 Google Chrome」触发自动更新，或从官网 https://www.google.com/chrome/ 下载最新安装包覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，可在企业策略中禁用 HTML5 视频/音频播放功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=118273","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-and-beta-channel-updates.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/81041","http://secunia.com/advisories/48732","http://secunia.com/advisories/48749","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-03.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52913","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026892","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74631","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3071","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e4112