7728","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-and-beta-channel-updates.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/81039","http://secunia.com/advisories/48732","http://secunia.com/advisories/48749","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-03.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52913","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026892","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74629","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3069.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3069","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3069","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3069.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3069","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3069","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3069.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3069.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5fdfbea5488ba49f22de39695f7fb2a1c3fcc184/2011/CVE-2011-3069.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-3069"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0201.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0200","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3068","title":"Google Chrome CSS 实现释放后使用漏洞","description":"\" wrapper that seems to have confused the Rust parser, resulting in \"description field empty\" errors.\n\nLet me analyze the information:\n\nNVD description: Use-after-free vulnerability in the Cascading Style Sheets (CSS) implementation in Google Chrome before 18.0.1025.151 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service or possibly have unspecified other impact via vectors related to run-in boxes.\n\nCWE-416, CVSS 6.8 (MEDIUM), published 2012-04-05.\n\nLocal data: AVD title: Apple iOS 至 5.1.1 WebKit 资源管理漏洞 (this is a WebKit/CSS issue affecting Apple iOS too). Tenable notes about Chrome before 18.0.1025.151 with various use-after-free issues including \"run-in\" handling.\n\nThe fix needs to be a clean Chinese description, ≥50 characters, covering: principle (use-after-free in CSS run-in box handling), impact scope (Google Chrome before 18.0.1025.151, also affects Apple iOS WebKit up to 5.1.1 per AVD), attack conditions (remote, user must visit a crafted webpage; no authentication needed).\n\nThe output must only be inside <value>...","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3068"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-05T22:02:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:33Z","remediation":"\" wrapper that made the Rust parser think the field is empty (because it's wrapped in the wrong format).\n\nLooking at the current TOML, the remediation field contains:\n```\nremediation = \"\"\"\ntags.CVE-2011-3068 是 Google Chrome 18.0.1025.151 之前版本 CSS 实现（run-in boxes 相关）的 use-after-free 漏洞，可导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行；同时影响 iOS 6.0 之前 WebKit 内核（AVD 编号对应 Apple iOS）。\n\n<value>升级 Google Chrome 至 18.0.1025.151 或更高版本，可通过「设置-关于」触发自动更新，或从 Google 官网下载最新稳定版覆盖安装；企业环境应通过组策略或 MDM 统一推送 Chrome 及 Apple iOS 6.0 以上系统的安全更新。无法立即升级时，临时缓解措施包括：配置浏览器为高安全级别并禁用 JavaScript/CSS 内联样式渲染，对不可信网站启用沙箱隔离浏览，以及在网络层通过 Web 代理过滤可疑脚本和样式表内容，降低触发 run-in 盒状处理缺陷的利用风险。\"\"\"\n```\n\nThe issue: the field has \"tags.\" prefix and \"<value>\" wrapper inside a triple-quoted TOML string. The Rust layer extracts only content between <value> and\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=117698","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-and-beta-channel-updates.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/81038","http://secunia.com/advisories/48732","http://secunia.com/advisories/48749","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-03.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52913","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026892","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74628","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3068","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3068","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3068.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3068","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3068","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3068.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3068.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2011/CVE-2011-3068.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3068"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0199","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3067","title":"Google Chrome WebKit 同源策略绕过漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 18.0.1025.151 之前的版本存在同源策略（Same Origin Policy）绕过漏洞，根因是浏览器在处理跨源 IFRAME 元素的替换操作时源验证不充分。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，诱导用户访问后通过替换 IFRAME 元素等向量绕过浏览器的同源隔离机制，进而读取或操作其他源的页面数据，导致敏感信息泄露，并可能进一步篡改页面内容。该漏洞影响 Apple iOS 5.1.1 及更早版本内置的 WebKit 内核以及 Chrome 等多个平台，攻击条件要求用户主动访问恶意构造的页面，CVSS 评分为 6.8，危害等级中等偏上。Google 已在 Chrome 18.0.1025.151 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3067"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-05T22:02:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 18.0.1025.151 及以上版本（Stable Channel 2012 年 4 月 4 日更新），企业环境可通过组策略强制推送该版本并禁用旧版本升级检查绕过；同时将 Apple iOS/Safari 升级至 6.0 及以上版本以修复 WebKit 内核缺陷。若无法立即升级，可在浏览器或 Web 应用中设置严格内容安全策略（Content-Security-Policy，禁用 frame-src 不可信来源）、部署 X-Frame-Options: DENY 或 frame-ancestors 响应头，并启用 Site Isolation 阻止跨源 iframe 注入，以缓解同源策略绕过风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=117583","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-and-beta-channel-updates.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/81037","http://secunia.com/advisories/48732","http://secunia.com/advisories/48749","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-03.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52913","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026892","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74627","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15342","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3067.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3067","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3067","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3067.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3067","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3067","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3067.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2011/CVE-2011-3067.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3067.yml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3067.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0198","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3066","title":"Google Chrome Skia 越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 18.0.1025.151 之前版本所使用的 Skia 图形引擎存在越界读（Out-of-Bounds Read）漏洞（CWE-125）。该漏洞源于 Skia 在进行裁剪（Clipping）操作时未正确验证边界，导致可读取超出分配内存范围的数据。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含特制图形内容的恶意网页触发该漏洞，可能导致信息泄露或浏览器拒绝服务（崩溃），在特定条件下甚至可能与其他漏洞组合实现任意代码执行。由于 Chrome 浏览器在当时具有极高的市场份额，该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击条件为用户需访问恶意构造的网页，属于低复杂度但需用户交互的攻击场景。Google 已在 Chrome 18.0.1025.151 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3066"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-05T22:02:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:33Z","remediation":"content.The known info already tells me the fix version is 18.0.1025.151. I'll write the remediation directly.<value>建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级到 18.0.1025.151 或更高版本（该版本修复了 Skia 裁剪逻辑中的越界读问题），同时通过浏览器\"关于 Chrome\"菜单或企业级自动更新策略（如 GPO、管理后台的更新配置）批量推送补丁至所有终端。如无法立即升级，可临时启用浏览器安全模式、禁用第三方插件与自动加载的可信站点外内容，并通过内容安全策略（CSP）和限制恶意网页访问降低触发概率，同时监控异常崩溃日志以辅助检测利用尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=106577","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-and-beta-channel-updates.html","http://osvdb.org/81036","http://secunia.com/advisories/48732","http://secunia.com/advisories/48749","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-03.xml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52913","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026892","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15453","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74626","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3066","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3066.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3066","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3066","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3066.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47bb69b00d30a4ddac9a224d4b4672d3efbf78ef/2011/CVE-2011-3066.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3066.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3066.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3066"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0197","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3064","title":"Google Chrome SVG裁剪使用后释放远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 18.0.1025.142 之前版本存在使用后释放（use-after-free）漏洞，与 SVG 剪裁处理相关。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含特制 SVG 剪裁数据的网页，触发内存错误引用，导致拒绝服务或可能的其他未指定影响。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 18.0.1025.142 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。用户访问恶意网页即可触发该漏洞，无需额外交互条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3064"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-30T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:33Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 18.0.1025.142 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SVG clipping 路径中的 use-after-free 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 的 SVG 支持作为临时缓解措施，或通过组策略限制不受信任的 SVG 内容加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=117471","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/stable-channel-release-and-beta-channel.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","h