_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3062","title":"Google Chrome OpenType Sanitizer单字节溢出漏洞","description":"Google Chrome的OpenType Sanitizer组件存在单字节溢出错误（off-by-one），远程攻击者可通过向目标发送特制的OpenType字体文件触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务或可能的内存越界读取，影响Google Chrome 18.0.1025.142之前的所有版本。CWE-682（计算错误）类型的漏洞使得攻击者能够利用此缺陷造成程序不稳定或信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3062"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-30T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:32Z","remediation":"标签之间。<value>升级 Google Chrome 至 18.0.1025.142 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可暂时避免打开来源不可信的 OpenType 字体文件，并通过浏览器设置禁用网页自定义字体渲染作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=116524","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/stable-channel-release-and-beta-channel.html","http://osvdb.org/80740","http://secunia.com/advisories/48618","http://secunia.com/advisories/48691","http://secunia.com/advisories/48763","http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-31.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026877","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=739925","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74412","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15488","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/04cbba20eadf072d0c2a69a2764987d5116b9b8d/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3062","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3062","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a4bac3f294639f471e4ce83e9756b93968e8a651/CVE/data/2011/CVE-201