poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0194","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0194.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3059","title":"Google Chrome SVG 文本元素越界读取漏洞","description":"WebKit渲染引擎在处理SVG文本元素时存在越界读取漏洞。Google Chrome 18.0.1025.142之前版本以及采用旧版WebKit的浏览器（如Safari）受此影响。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的SVG网页，利用浏览器解析SVG文本元素时的内存访问越界，使浏览器进程崩溃拒绝服务，或在特定条件下读取敏感内存信息。该漏洞只需诱使用户访问包含恶意SVG内容的网页即可触发，无需复杂身份认证或特殊用户交互，攻击可在客户端无感知的情况下完成。Apple和Google已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3059"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-30T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:32Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iOS 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，或将 Google Chrome 升级至 18.0.1025.142 及以上版本，以修复 WebKit 组件中的内存破坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用浏览器中的 JavaScript 执行功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=112317","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/stable-channel-release-and-beta-channel.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48618","http://secunia.com/advisories/48691","http://secunia.com/advisories/48763","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52762","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026877","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74409","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15200","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67c9200e969a6d3d408c757f270927299404e0d3/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3059","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-