le Chrome CSS 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 在 17.0.963.83 版本前的 CSS 实现中存在使用后释放漏洞，源于对 CSS :first-letter 伪元素处理不当导致内存引用错误。远程攻击者可通过构造包含特制 :first-letter 伪元素的恶意网页，诱导用户访问触发使用后释放漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.83 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.8（中等危害），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需认证即可利用，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。Google 已在 Chrome 17.0.963.83 版本中修复此漏洞，用户应升级至该版本或更高版本修复漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3050"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-22T16:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:31Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.83 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单选择\"关于 Google Chrome\"自动更新，或访问 google.com/chrome 下载最新版本。若无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 CSS :first-letter 伪元素渲染或使用浏览器扩展禁用 CSS 样式作为临时缓解措施。建议启用 Chrome 自动更新功能以确保及时获取安全补丁。定期检查 chrome://settings/help 确认版本号不低于 17.0.963.83。企业环境可通过组策略配置 AutoUpdateEnabled 策略强制自动更新。如需临时缓解，可在企业策略中配置 ExtensionInstallBlocklist 禁用所有扩展以降低攻击面。建议部署端点防护软件监控浏览器进程异常行为。定期检查 chrome.google.com/webstore 确保安装的扩展来自可信来源。启用站点隔离功能以进一步降低渲染进程漏洞利用风险。配置企业策略 RendererCodeIntegrityEnabled 提升渲染进程安全性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=113902","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/stable-channel-update_21.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00000.html","http://osvdb.org/80288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48512","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52674","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026841","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74210","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14414","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3050","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3050","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3050.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3050","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3050","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a611a7d397ce100357a922cf54bc17349e089319/2011/CVE-2011-3050.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3050.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3050.yml","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-3050"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0190.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0188","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3045","title":"libpng 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"libpng 库的 png_inflate() 函数在处理 PNG 文件时存在整数符号错误，导致堆缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响 libpng 1.4.10beta01 之前版本，Google Chrome 17.0.963.83 之前版本及其他使用受影响 libpng 的产品。远程攻击者可诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 PNG 文件，触发整数溢出导致堆缓冲区溢出，进而造成应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或在用户上下文中执行任意代码。攻击需要用户交互（打开恶意文件），CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（高危），属于整数溢出与符号转换错误类漏洞（CWE-190, CWE-195）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-